WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:11.070
Before you can use the ONE bot, you need
to register as a panelist.

2
00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:15.550
It only takes a few minutes, and you do it
from your mobile phone, in Telegram.

3
00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.750
This short guide shows you how.

4
00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.430
Before you start, check two things.

5
00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:24.270
First, Telegram is installed on your
phone.

6
00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:31.270
Second, you know the email address your
manager used to register you in ONEMS.

7
00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:38.970
In Telegram, tap the search icon and type
@OneMSBot.

8
00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:45.970
Open the bot and tap Start, or type
/start.

9
00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:51.020
The bot doesn’t recognise you yet, so it
asks for your email.

10
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.500
The message appears in four languages at
once: English, French, Spanish and Arabic.

11
00:00:57.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Type only your email address, with no
other text.

12
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:09.860
If your manager has already registered
you, the bot finds your email and links
your account.

13
00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:11.740
It replies with a welcome message.

14
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:13.940
That’s it. You are registered.

15
00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:20.460
Type /start and the menu appears.

16
00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:26.660
If your email is not in ONEMS, the bot
registers you with seven questions, one at
a time.

17
00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.540
Answer each one by typing.

18
00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:35.020
Your full name, your mobile number, your
street: only the street where your parcels
will arrive.

19
00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:39.700
Extra address details such as floor or
door, or type no.

20
00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:43.220
Your postal code, your city and your
country.

21
00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.740
When you finish, the bot tells you that
your registration is complete.

22
00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:50.580
Type /start to see the menu.

23
00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:55.620
If you see the message “Something went
wrong”, the bot did not recognise your
country.

24
00:01:55.620 --> 00:02:02.620
Write to the email address shown in the
message and you will be registered
manually.

25
00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:06.880
After registration, everything is done
with the menu buttons.

26
00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:11.240
The guide is under the Help button, or
type /help.

27
00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:18.160
To change your language, phone, email or
address, tap Report incident, then Change
my details.

28
00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.440
Welcome to the panel.
